### `2026-08-14T03:00:00Z` · what-is-ocr

**Question:** what is ocr
**Answer:** Optical Character Recognition — software that reads text from a photo or PDF of a page so you can edit it as real text. In this app it would turn a scanned recipe card into ingredients/steps; today we only store the file.
**Tags:** scan-import, ocr
